{"SystemName":"NewsLetterSubscription.ActivationMessage","Title":"{{Store.Name}} B\u00FClten Aboneli\u011Fi Onay\u0131","Content":"\u003Ctable width=\u0022100%\u0022 cellspacing=\u00220\u0022 cellpadding=\u00220\u0022 border=\u00220\u0022 style=\u0022max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333; border-collapse: collapse;\u0022\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022padding: 20px; background-color: #f7f7f7; text-align: center;\u0022\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022{{Store.URL}}/logo.png\u0022 alt=\u0022{{Store.Name}}\u0022 style=\u0022max-width: 200px; height: auto;\u0022\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022padding: 40px 30px; background-color: #ffffff;\u0022\u003E\u003Ch1 style=\u0022font-size: 24px; color: #333333; margin-top: 0;\u0022\u003EB\u00FClten Aboneli\u011Finizi Onaylay\u0131n\u003C/h1\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 25px;\u0022\u003EMerhaba,\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 25px;\u0022\u003E{{Store.Name}} b\u00FCltenine abone olmak i\u00E7in yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131z ba\u015Fvuruyu onaylaman\u0131z\u0131 rica ediyoruz. Aboneli\u011Finizi tamamlamak ve \u00F6zel f\u0131rsatlardan, g\u00FCncel haberlerden ve kampanyalardan haberdar olmak i\u00E7in a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131daki butona t\u0131klay\u0131n.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\u0022\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022{{NewsLetterSubscription.ActivationUrl}}\u0022 style=\u0022display: inline-block; padding: 12px 25px; background-color: #4CAF50; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;\u0022\u003EAboneli\u011Fimi Onayla\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 25px;\u0022\u003EBu e-postay\u0131 yanl\u0131\u015Fl\u0131kla ald\u0131ysan\u0131z, l\u00FCtfen dikkate almay\u0131n v